Task 5: Recommendation System Development

Objective
To build a functional recommendation system capable of providing personalized suggestions to users, applying advanced machine learning concepts for a real-world application.

Dataset
A standard dataset for recommendations, such as the Heart Disease Dataset.

Tools and Techniques
    | Tool/Library            | Technique/Concept                                                                              | 
    | :-----------------------| :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------: | 
    | Surprise, Scikit-learn  | Implementing recommendation algorithms.                                                        |
    | Collaborative Filtering | Utilizing User-based (finding similar users) or Item-based (finding similar items) filtering.  | 
    | Content-Based Filtering | Recommending items based on their features and the user's past preferences.                    | 
    | Evaluation Metrics      | Calculating metrics like Precision@K, Recall@K, and Coverage.                                  | 
    | Cold Start Problem      | Developing strategies to handle new users or new items with no existing data.                  | 


